  "details": "I have very slow internet that uses cellular data (under 1mb/s), and It's connected to my PC via LAN cable, optical fiber not an option where I live. I want to meet with my fellow furry friends inside like popcorn palace, but the first thing I see when I join, is the diamond loading avatar's and it really annoys me, and I feel very awkward being near them and I can't really interact with diamond loading avatar's. Since there is \"Preload World\" button on worlds, I would like if there was \"Preload Avatar\" button on people's profile, so I could already see their avatars when I join the world, and already cached. VRChat team, please consider to implement this.",
